---
<section id="work" class="section wrap reveal" data-delay="1">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Karya</p>
      <h2>Project pilihan</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="section-desc">Dua project utama selama di Raion, dengan peran yang jelas di tiap tim.</p>
  </div>
  <article class="project project-feature win">
    <div class="win-bar" aria-hidden="true"><span class="win-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span><span class="win-title">bingo — arvian@fedora</span><span class="win-spacer"></span></div>
    <div class="win-content">
    <div class="project-text">
      <div class="project-top">
        <span class="tag">Raion Intern · Mobile Engineer</span>
        <span class="tag muted">Tim 2 Mobile Engineer</span>
      </div>
      <h3>BinGo</h3>
      <p>Aplikasi yang kami bangun saat intern di Raion Community. Aku sebagai Mobile Engineer, mengerjakan antarmuka dan alur pakai Jetpack Compose bareng satu Mobile Engineer lain.</p>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>UI dan navigasi dengan Jetpack Compose</li>
        <li>Kolaborasi lintas peran di tim</li>
        <li>Struktur project yang rapi dan mudah dirawat</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="project-actions">
        <span class="pill">Kotlin, Jetpack Compose</span>
        <span class="pill-note">Repo internal Raion</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="project-visual" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="visual-frame">
        <div class="frame-body">
          <p class="frame-k">~/bingo — preview</p>
          <div class="frame-lines"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <div class="frame-cards"><span></span><span></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="visual-caption">Gambaran alur aplikasi</p>
    </div>
    </div>
  </article>
  <div class="project-grid single">
    <article class="project win project-compact">
      <div class="win-bar" aria-hidden="true"><span class="win-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span><span class="win-title">kawal.z — arvian@fedora</span><span class="win-spacer"></span></div>
      <div class="win-body">
      <div class="compact-head">
        <span class="tag">Raion Hackjam · 1 minggu</span>
        <h3>Kawal.Z</h3>
        <p>Dibuat dalam seminggu untuk Raion Hackjam. Satu tim berisi 3 orang: Product Manager, UI/UX, dan aku sebagai Mobile Engineer. Di sini aku pakai Flutter dari workshop Raion.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="compact-meta">
        <span class="pill">Flutter</span>
        <span class="pill muted">Workshop Raion</span>
      </div>
      <ul class="compact-list">
        <li>Product Manager · arah dan scope</li>
        <li>UI/UX · alur dan desain</li>
        <li>Mobile Engineer · implementasi Flutter</li>
      </ul>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
